  "id": "critical-region",
  "term": "critical region",
  "definition": "A critical region is an area of the brain considered especially important in a particular condition or function because changes there are closely linked to key problems or outcomes. In this source, it refers to a brain area strongly involved in axonal degeneration and cognitive change in subjective cognitive decline.",
